  body: `Prior Lessons — 1-Sentence Recap

Lesson 093: CXL can improve memory utilization while moving control toward switches, controllers, orchestration software and validated system behavior.

Lesson 094: A structural shift matters only when shared interfaces, learning and incentives produce repeatable output across many participants.

